# Interactive wizard recording: full npx projectops install on a sample Spring project (record_cli.sh fills {{...}})
# All 11 questions use defaults: install scope > kind > deploy > PR comments > development branch > create develop > push > Secret backup > confirm > env values > skills
# Wait for ◆ on the first question only, then Enter every 2.5s (measured question gap under 2s)
# Wait+Screen reads only the top lines once the screen scrolls and misses ◆ (vhs 0.12) > use a fixed interval

Output "{{OUTPUT_DIR}}/cli-wizard{{SUFFIX}}.gif"
Require node

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 820
Set Padding 20
{{FONT_FAMILY_LINE}}
Set FontSize 14
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WaitTimeout 120s

Hide
Type `cd {{WORK_DIR}}/wizard/demo-app && export PROJECTOPS_LANG={{LANG}} PS1='$ ' && npx() { shift; node {{RUNNER}} {{WORK_DIR}}/template "$@"; } && clear`
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "npx projectops"
Sleep 400ms
Enter

Wait+Screen /◆/
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter

Sleep 8s
